# 7. AREA FIVE – SMELTING FOUNDRY

The foundry should be integrated into the rear or deeper portion of the Mining Galleries.

It should NOT become an entirely isolated giant room.

### Furnaces

Create three or four large industrial furnaces.

Each furnace should have:
- Thick stone construction.
- Reinforced iron plates.
- A large glowing opening.
- Orange firelight.
- Chimneys extending upward.
- Metal pipes.

### Molten metal processing

Build channels carved into the stone floor.

These channels can carry molten metal toward casting molds.

Add:
- Metal containers.
- Casting molds.
- Anvils.
- Blacksmithing tools.
- Ore storage bins.
- Mechanical bellows.
- Industrial cranes.

### Visual appearance

The foundry should be dark, industrial and warm.

Its orange glow should contrast with the blue waterfall environment.

IMPORTANT:

These are normal industrial dwarven furnaces.

The giant dragon-head furnace belongs exclusively in the final treasure chamber.

Do not confuse the two areas.

