# 8. AREA SIX – GRAND DESCENT

Create a monumental descending route from the southern part of the Main Mine Hall toward the lower cavern.

### Architecture

- Wide stone stairs.
- Tall carved pillars.
- Iron chains.
- Large stone balconies.
- Dwarven inscriptions.
- Torches.
- Natural rock walls.

The descent must feel like entering a much older and deeper part of the kingdom.

### Verticality

Use the descent to create a visual reveal.

The player should gradually see:
- The enormous lower cavern.
- The abyss.
- Distant stone formations.
- Parts of the Great Bridge.
- The waterfalls descending into the depths.

Use multiple stair sections and intermediate platforms rather than one excessively long staircase.

