Warm torchlight, subtle golden details and dark stone.

### Main Mine Hall
Warm industrial lighting, lanterns, furnaces and mechanical highlights.

### Waterfall
Cool blue and turquoise light, reflections and soft atmospheric lighting.

### Mining Galleries
Warm work lights mixed with colored mineral illumination.

### Smelting Foundry
Strong orange furnace light, dark metal and visible heat.

